  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra\n\t\t<ul><li>Giá trị lớn nhất của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li>Giá trị nhỏ nhất của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mo>min</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
